<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Union Acceptance started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Union Acceptance started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said Tuesday it initiated coverage of Union Acceptance Corp with a buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-3/8 at 18-7/8 in early afternoon trading on the Nasdaq.</p>
